{"id": "3007449", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3007449", "title": "Cincinnati Masters 2023 \u2013 Dublu masculin", "text": "Cincinnati Masters 2023 \u2013 Dublu masculin a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii august 2023. Dou\u0103zeci \u0219i opt de perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Mason, Ohio, Statele Unite, pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103, \u00een exterior. \nRajeev Ram \u0219i Joe Salisbury au fost campionii en-titre, dar au pierdut \u00een runda a doua \u00een fa\u021ba perechii M\u00e1ximo Gonz\u00e1lez \u0219i Andr\u00e9s Molteni.\nM\u00e1ximo Gonz\u00e1lez \u0219i Andr\u00e9s Molteni au \u00eenvins \u00een final\u0103 perechea Jamie Murray \u0219i Michael Venus cu scorul de 3\u20136, 6\u20131, [11\u20139] \u0219i au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul de dublu masculin la Cincinnati Masters 2023. Eu au salvat o minge de meci \u00een drumul lor spre primul lor titlu ATP 1000.\nThey saved a championship point en route to their first ATP Tour Masters 1000 title.\nCapi de serie.\nPrimele patru perechi intr\u0103 direct \u00een runda a doua."}
