{"id": "3008207", "revid": "724996", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3008207", "title": "Lista depourilor CFR", "text": "C\u0103ile Ferate Rom\u00e2ne sunt compuse din material rulant c\u00e2t si din calea ferat\u0103. Materialul rulant apar\u021bine unor depouri situate de-a lungul \u021b\u0103rii.\nAstfel, exist\u0103 dou\u0103 tipuri de depouri CFR: depouri de c\u0103l\u0103tori \u0219i depouri de marf\u0103.\nDepourile de locomotive de c\u0103l\u0103tori.\nDepourile de c\u0103l\u0103tori din Rom\u00e2nia sunt:\nDepoul de locomotive Satu Mare.\nDepoul de locomotive Satu Mare are \u00een dotare locomotive diesel \u0219i automotoare.\nDepoul de locomotive Cluj-Napoca.\nDepoul de locomotive Cluj-Napoca are \u00een dotare locomotive electrice, diesel, de manevr\u0103 c\u00e2t \u0219i automotoare.\nDepoul de locomotive Arad.\nDepoul de locomotive Arad are \u00een dotare locomotive electrice, Diesel electrice, respectiv Diesel hidraulice \nDepoul de locomotive Timi\u0219oara.\nDepoul de locomotive Timisoara are \u00een dotare locomotive electrice, diesel si automotoare.\nDepoul de locomotive Bucure\u0219ti C\u0103l\u0103tori.\nDepoul de locomotive Bucure\u0219ti C\u0103l\u0103tori este cel mai mare depou de locomotive din Rom\u00e2nia \u0219i are \u00een dotare \nDepoul de locomotive Ploie\u0219ti.\nDepoul de locomotive Ploie\u0219ti are \u00een dotare locomotive electrice. Este singurul depou de locomotive de c\u0103l\u0103tori din Rom\u00e2nia care are numai Locomotive Electrice Tip A in dotare, deoarece ultimele Locomotive Diesel ramase au fost transferate la alte depouri. \nDepoul de locomotive Pite\u0219ti.\nDepoul de locomotive Pite\u0219ti are \u00een dotare \nDepoul de locomotive Sibiu.\nDepoul de locomotive Sibiu are \u00een dotare \nDepoul de locomotive Bra\u0219ov.\nDepoul de locomotive Bra\u0219ov are \u00een dotare locomotive electrice si automotoare.\nDepoul de locomotive Gala\u021bi.\nDepoul de locomotive Gala\u021bi are \u00een dotare \nDepoul de locomotive Ia\u0219i.\nDepoul de locomotive Ia\u0219i are \u00een dotare \nDepoul de locomotive Suceava Nord.\nDepoul de locomotive Suceava Nord are \u00een dotare locomotive electrice, diesel \u0219i automotoare."}
