{"id": "3008617", "revid": "322190", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3008617", "title": "Alexander Zinoviev", "text": "Alexander Zinoviev (\u00een ; ) a fost un scriitor rus \u0219i disident din URSS.\n\u00cen 1978 i-a fost retras\u0103 cet\u0103\u021benia sovietic\u0103. Din 1978 p\u00e2n\u0103 \u00een 1999 a tr\u0103it la M\u00fcnchen. \n\u00cen 1981 a publicat \"Homo sovieticus\", \u00een care a criticat birocra\u021bia sovietic\u0103."}
